# SPEC GOLDEN — hand-written from CSS 2.1 §11.1.1, never regenerated.
#
# `overflow` changes what is *painted*, never where a box goes: every
# coordinate below is what the same page lays out to with the property
# removed. What the property adds to this dump is the `overflow=` clause,
# which is how F3 explains content that vanished.
#
# .menu    height 0 -> used height 0, and the flow advances by 0, so the
#          next sibling starts at the same row. Its two <p> children keep
#          their boxes at rows 0 and 1 — they exist, they are laid out, and
#          the clip means they reach no cell.
# .card    starts at row 0 (the menu took none). max-height 2em = 2 lines
#          clamps its auto height of 3, so its third <p> at row 2 is outside
#          the padding box and clipped away.
# .side    starts at row 2 (0 + .card's used 2). width 10em = 20 cells.
#          <pre> does not wrap, so its 36-cell line overflows the 20-cell
#          padding box; overflow-x clips it and overflow-y stays visible,
#          which is the `hidden/visible` clause.
#
# Page height: the flow ends at 3, and the lowest border box (card's third
# <p>, side's line) also ends at 3.
#
# Surviving rows, worked out by hand — pinned as a cell grid by
# `overflow_clip_snapshot` in tests/snapshots.rs:
#   row 0  "card one"                 (.menu's row 0 is clipped away)
#   row 1  "card two"
#   row 2  "0123456789abcdefghij"     (20 of 36 cells)
<html>  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=3
  <body>  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=3
    <div.menu>  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=0 overflow=hidden
      <p>  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=1
          line  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=1
            #text "hidden nav one"  x=0 y=0 w=14 h=1
      <p>  x=0 y=1 w=40 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=1 w=40 h=1
          line  x=0 y=1 w=40 h=1
            #text "hidden nav two"  x=0 y=1 w=14 h=1
    <div.card>  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=2 overflow=hidden
      <p>  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=1
          line  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=1
            #text "card one"  x=0 y=0 w=8 h=1
      <p>  x=0 y=1 w=40 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=1 w=40 h=1
          line  x=0 y=1 w=40 h=1
            #text "card two"  x=0 y=1 w=8 h=1
      <p>  x=0 y=2 w=40 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=2 w=40 h=1
          line  x=0 y=2 w=40 h=1
            #text "card three"  x=0 y=2 w=10 h=1
    <div.side>  x=0 y=2 w=20 h=1 overflow=hidden/visible
      <pre>  x=0 y=2 w=20 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=2 w=20 h=1
          line  x=0 y=2 w=20 h=1
            #text "0123456789abcdefghi…"  x=0 y=2 w=36 h=1
